check 1
# The items channel on gheed-stock's store fill (store, trade): the NPC flow of
# items-vendor-akara-stock (0x13 interact, 0x2F chat, 0x38 action 1;
# world/vendors.md §3-§5) with the player poked towards the NPC in steps
# (each point inside a room already active). NPC position from the 1.14d
# town recording (pc1-data.md q-diff-combat-a1). Authored by q-chk-items-vendors.
name items-vendor-gheed-stock
save ScnBuy --class ama --expansion --gold 5000
seed 1234
ticks 30
seconds 300
channels items
at 4 poke pos @player 4860 4236
at 7 poke pos @player 4848 4250
at 10 poke pos @player 4840 4264
at 13 poke pos @player 4838 4272
at 16 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:147
at 18 send InitEntityChat id=@1:147
at 20 send EntityAction action=1 npc=@1:147 item=0
